  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_2038.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este domingo las fiestas del Cam&iacute; Castell&oacute; y calles adyacentes de Onda se han dedicado principalmente a ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as, con encierro infantil a mediod&iacute;a, y castillos hinchables ma&ntilde;ana y tarde. La noche ha sido para los mayores, con la actuaci&oacute;n del grupo Ronda 7 en la calle San Luis.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestescamicastello13/img_2031.jpg\" alt=\"img_2031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestescamicastello13/img_2032.jpg\" alt=\"img_2032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestescamicastello13/img_2033.jpg\" alt=\"img_2033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestescamicastello13/img_2034.jpg\" alt=\"img_2034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestescamicastello13/img_2035.jpg\" alt=\"img_2035\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestescamicastello13/img_2036.jpg\" alt=\"img_2036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestescamicastello13/img_2037.jpg\" alt=\"img_2037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestescamicastello13/img_2038.jpg\" alt=\"img_2038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439e